  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Stephen Miller said there is a \"revolution in quantum computing, artificial intelligence, advanced manufacturing\" and that the semiconductor industry is being brought back to the United States. In September 2024, he wrote about investing heavily in advanced manufacturing, including AI and robotics, along with energy policies and R&D tax credits. In October 2024, he asked whether investment should go to farm automation, addressing a recipient as someone passionate about AI. In February 2024, he wrote, \"Imagine when woke AI is governing every financial transaction in America.\"",
